{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6464d87a056a3ea3021a91f4c006dbfb9d803c42267d90399ae7d4c1cd570ab5","ja":"恵美の相談","zh":"惠美的商量","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"87465ca6b32b469104660075826f255fffb01f36cd03b50cbd37d07c458acf23","ja":"とあるオフの日。紗代子と茜は、恵美から\n相談があると言われて、ファミレスに来ていて……","zh":"某个休息日。纱代子和茜因为听惠美说\n有事想商量，便来到了家庭餐厅……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"86abe4ea67f2e8b8536f9140578a87658b60da6de6274267ca63922a9e8ed20c","ja":"ふたりとも、来てくれてありがと。\nこの後は、何時まで大丈夫？","zh":"你们两个，谢谢能过来。\n在这之后，可以待到几点？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"293b61836790a80880c9b44d50ab51ccc63ef2de385fea238b7f7ca74cd46136","ja":"何時でも大丈夫だよ！　恵美ちゃんの悩みが\n解決するまで、いくらでも付き合うから！","zh":"什么时候都没问题哦！在恵美的事烦恼\n解决之前，不管多久我都会陪着你的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"57495183b8d87840e4ab966824deae07460a3981d9a250c7e7e7e9dc0b742c8a","ja":"茜ちゃんもバッチリ時間あけといたから、\nなんでも相談してね☆","zh":"小茜的时间也已经腾得妥妥当当了，\n有什么事尽管找我商量哦☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"65f674db7e360f5f81de28d4ee79144e0fc5f59ec3835eccc269304dabdeaac2","ja":"ありがと！　実は雑誌の企画で、ここのお店の\nイチオシメニューを選ぶことになったんだけど……。","zh":"谢谢！其实是因为杂志的企划，要挑出这家店\n最推荐的招牌菜式……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"04c0f2b6c1244013281435b2e1851068847d9954c97f07605d335d00d85869ab","ja":"も～全然決まらなくてさ～！　なに食べても\n美味しいし。だからふたりの意見も聞きたくて。","zh":"真是的～完全拿不定主意啦～！吃什么都\n很好吃嘛。所以才想听听你们两个人的意见。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"10ddc1718f4bb558da3c611d18c70cb8a1e84519738895bad9f625367ec16a65","ja":"なるほど……。雑誌を見て同じのを注文する人も\nいるだろうし、しっかり選ばないといけないよね！","zh":"原来如此……也会有人看了杂志后点同样的东西，\n所以必须好好挑选才行呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"541189ab2ab13959f5d81818d0678a48025742efcb236dbaa6dddd6b26230b84","ja":"そうなの！\nでも考えれば考えるほど迷っちゃって！","zh":"就是说啊！\n但我越想反而越拿不定主意了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"dcc1c34b787a6ea3794ae79a6049867ce9c44dda1720ab3b09774f60cc8b4f6e","ja":"それじゃあ、食べながら考えよ♪\n茜ちゃんは……あっ！　限定プリンがある！","zh":"那就边吃边想吧♪\n小茜选……啊！有期间限定布丁！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e53b6cb8e00b2947bf8829c274070664dce6eacda490f89d4f1f92d2869b791f","ja":"えっ、デザートから頼むの？","zh":"诶，先点甜品吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7496d6aad8f3df5f857c0ff193d575bd8b2d6ea333744c23e50b18bef4c0f09e","ja":"スイーツとかご飯ものとか、あんま\n気にしないで頼んでもいいんじゃない？","zh":"甜品还是主食什么的，不用那么\n在意，随便点不就好了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"25d216a29b02c2fb72162fd4e5f402b823eaaa5fe85ced50845d3824f7f0124b","ja":"それもそうだね。好きなように注文して、\nみんなでシェアしよ。","zh":"说得也是呢。点自己喜欢的，\n然后大家一起分着吃吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"7485cc4be2d6a7d99fbc8bc0bc3f5ffee89eeea289e37b07cbaaee4c4c9ec463","ja":"私は最初は食事系から……あっ！\nミニたい焼き付きぜんざいがある！","zh":"我一开始先从正餐类开始……啊！\n有附带迷你鲷鱼烧的红豆汤！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"74e9b1f8529703d6793cb25760c538739c955ca930ec484e961140fa527e345b","ja":"わ、私はこれでっ！","zh":"我、我先告辞了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"81e0034373bcf4d0ab3f85c3a44d5465e2643d6f04e07f91af57db30e11dfd3c","ja":"にゃははっ！　結局、紗代子も甘い物から\n注文しちゃってるじゃ～ん！","zh":"喵哈哈！结果纱代子也先\n点上甜食了嘛～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1666.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"b9cdefe782a4cffe97afe4f193cb2599b14b1c63f6199325d217f142eac1e734","ja":"アタシは最初は……チーズドリアを頼んじゃおっと！\nもちろんドリンクバーはマストでね☆","zh":"我一开始要……点芝士焗饭！\n饮料畅饮当然也是必不可少的啦☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
